===Available Blox Fruits===
There are currently '''42''' Blox Fruits in the game, including:
* 22 [[Natural]] Blox Fruits
* 11 [[Elemental]] Blox Fruits
* 9 [[Beast]] Blox Fruits
{{Blox Fruit/List}}

===Mutations===
{{Main|Mutations}}
Mutations are modified versions of Blox Fruits, which alter their appearance, movesets and playstyle. There are currently three mutations in the game, with all of them being event-exclusive and of type [[Beast]].

